                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.23.0"&gt;3.23.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Baggage tags are automatically added as span tags&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Fix resource-based sampling for ASP.NET Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Various fixes for commit info and codeowners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Fix crash with Allure.Xunit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[IAST] Fix potential crash on &lt;code&gt;ReadOnlySpan&amp;lt;&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;string.Concat()&lt;/code&gt; methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;feat(baggage): adding baggage to span tags (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3095103121" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7020" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7020/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7020"&gt;#7020&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Swap disposal ordering of inferred span (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3271139018" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7293" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7293/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7293"&gt;#7293&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;[MethodImpl(MethodImplOptions.NoInlining]&lt;/code&gt; to all our instrumented APIs in Datadog.Trace.Manual (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3276841346" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7302" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7302/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7302"&gt;#7302&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refactor &lt;code&gt;TraceSampler&lt;/code&gt; to separate building from evaluation (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3280539499" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7311" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7311/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7311"&gt;#7311&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avoid generating resource name that will be thrown away if it's not required (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3280568396" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7312" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7312/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7312"&gt;#7312&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix resource-based sampling for ASP.NET Core (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3281161832" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7316" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7316/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7316"&gt;#7316&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;CI Visibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Retrieve head commit info (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3268206839" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7285" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7285/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7285"&gt;#7285&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Add codeowners and test source file tag at suite level (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3273009741" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7295" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7295/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7295"&gt;#7295&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Fix base branch SHA usage (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3276236261" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7300" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7300/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7300"&gt;#7300&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Optimization] Avoid crashing on Allure.Xunit usage (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3279806072" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7305" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7305/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7305"&gt;#7305&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ASM&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[AAP] Update WAF to v1.27.0 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3288319640" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7330" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7330/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7330"&gt;#7330&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Continuous Profiler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Use ringbuffer with timer create (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3120829802" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7066" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7066/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7066"&gt;#7066&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[IAST] Remove troublesome string.Concat overloads with ReadOnlySpan (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3282712048" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7318" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7318/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7318"&gt;#7318&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Miscellaneous&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set default timeout for Trace Exporter to 15s. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3249807919" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7252" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7252/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7252"&gt;#7252&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[OTEL] OTLP Metrics Exporter POC (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3173222171" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7138" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7138/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7138"&gt;#7138&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Test Package Versions Bump] Updating package versions (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3263366018" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7279" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7279/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7279"&gt;#7279&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Add vcpkg setup for build (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3270361031" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7292" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7292/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7292"&gt;#7292&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure file_opened_ is getting updated when rotating (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3273231405" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7296" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7296/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7296"&gt;#7296&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump rejit timeout to 200ms (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3276442474" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7301" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7301/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7301"&gt;#7301&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Build / Test&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Filter connection header in flaky tests (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3270108993" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7290" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7290/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7290"&gt;#7290&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove global state to try to fix flake (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3270143305" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7291" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7291/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7291"&gt;#7291&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve repeatability &amp;amp; precision of throughput tests on Linux &amp;amp; ARM (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3256480668" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7268" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7268/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7268"&gt;#7268&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More fixes for do-not-merge (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3259328160" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7274" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7274/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7274"&gt;#7274&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update the Windows test agent to latest (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3259595447" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7275" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7275/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7275"&gt;#7275&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix potential deadlocks in &lt;code&gt;IisFixture&lt;/code&gt; process code (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3263731667" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7281" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7281/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7281"&gt;#7281&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Fix and bump timeitsharp (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3272639548" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7294" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7294/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7294"&gt;#7294&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix debug symbol upload in release (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3274037584" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7297" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7297/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7297"&gt;#7297&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional test that requires HTTP FP connection header scrubbing (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3279837530" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7306" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7306/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7306"&gt;#7306&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
